# hw/end: once its answer is out, the driver ends at once with exit code 3, without another byte to the board, as if
# it had crashed. The start counts it like any other end of the driver; the one it starts again comes up latched.
# Offered where hw/capabilities has driver_end; the setup program measures with it how the board stops without its
# host.
---
bool success
string message
# Why it was refused, empty otherwise: READ_ONLY, CHARGING (on the charging contacts), BLADE (blade on or
# still turning).
string code
